sible.\n\nI cannot form any rocket (need both jokers), and I don\'t have BlackJoker.\n\nSo **RedJoker has maximum value now as an unbeatable lead**.\n\nAlternatively, save it for later when I might need to reclaim lead? But if I play smaller cards now, they might take control and run their hands.\n\nGiven that both peasants passed previously, they may be holding fragmented or weak cards. Now is the time to press advantage.\n\nThus, playing **RedJoker** as a single is optimal: it secures the next turn for sure.\n\nReason: Playing RedJoker as a single guarantees winning the trick (unbeatable), allows me to retain initiative, and begins clearing high cards while peasants are likely weak. Saving it offers little benefit since I cannot form a rocket or bomb with it currently.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["RedJoker"]}'}
